{"sha": "fda17e5934d6b5c41c45f39226f8d58759127b811b4074fd2fbf283006209772", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b3:partition-functions} 章 --- 统计热力学：配分函数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:1}", "将每种分布写成四个振子所持有的量子数，按从大到小", "排列，“4, 0, 0, 0”：$4!/(3!\\,1!) = 4$；“3, 1, 0, 0”：$4!/(2!\\,1!\\,1!) = 12$；“2, 2, 0, 0”：", "$4!/(2!\\,2!) = 6$；“2, 1, 1, 0”：$4!/(1!\\,2!\\,1!) = 12$；“1, 1, 1, 1”：1。总数为 35 $= \\binom73$。", "最可几的是“3, 1, 0, 0”和“2, 1, 1, 0”（各为 12）；后者", "对应 0、1、2 个量子的布居数分别为 1、2、1，已随能量下降，", "与大数情形下的玻尔兹曼分布一致。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:2}", "$\\eu^{-2500/(8.314 \\times 298.15)} = \\eu^{-1.009} = 0.365$；在 \\qty{1000}{K} 时，$\\eu^{-0.301} = 0.740$。温度极高时，", "比值趋于 1（布居数相等，不会出现反转）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:3}", "$m = 39.95\\times10^{-3}/6.022\\times10^{23} = \\qty{6.634e-26}{kg}$; $\\Lambda = h/\\sqrt{2\\pi mkT} =", "\\qty{1.600e-11}{m} = \\qty{16.0}{pm}$; $q^{\\mathrm T} = 10^{-3}/(1.600\\times10^{-11})^3 = \\num{2.44e29}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:4}", "$hc/k = \\qty{1.4388}{cm.K}$. \\ce{N2}: $\\theta_{\\mathrm R} = \\qty{2.863}{K}$, $q^{\\mathrm R} = 298.15/(2 \\times 2.863) = 52.1$.", "\\ce{HCl}：$\\theta_{\\mathrm R} = \\qty{15.02}{K}$，$q^{\\mathrm R} = 298.15/15.02 = 19.85$（精确求和为 20.19）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:5}", "\\ce{I2}：$\\theta_{\\mathrm V} = 1.4388 \\times 213.27 = \\qty{306.9}{K}$，$q^{\\mathrm V} = 1/(1 - \\eu^{-1.029}) = 1.556$；", "激发比例 $1 - 1/q^{\\mathrm V} = 0.357$。\\ce{N2}：$\\theta_{\\mathrm V} = \\qty{3352}{K}$，$q^{\\mathrm V} = 1.000013$，", "激发比例 \\num{1.3e-5}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:6}", "\\ce{NO}：$q^{\\mathrm E} = 2 + 2\\eu^{-119.73/207.22} = 2 + 2 \\times 0.561 = 3.12$；高能级比例 $1.12/3.12", "= 0.36$。温度很高时 $q^{\\mathrm E} \\to 4$（两能级布居数相等）。\\ce{Cl}：", "$q^{\\mathrm E} = 4 + 2\\eu^{-882.35/207.22} = 4 + 2 \\times 0.0142 = 4.03$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:7}", "$\\ln q = \\ln V + \\frac32\\ln T + \\text{常数}$，因此 $U - U(0) = NkT^2 \\times \\frac{3}{2T} = \\frac32NkT$；对于一", "摩尔在 \\qty{298.15}{K} 时为 $\\frac32RT = \\qty{3.72}{kJ/mol}$，且 $C_V = \\frac32R = \\qty{12.47}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:8}", "$kT/p^\\circ = \\qty{4.116e-26}{m^3}$，$\\Lambda^3 = \\qty{4.093e-33}{m^3}$，比值为 \\num{1.006e7}：", "$S_{\\mathrm m} = 8.3145 \\times (16.124 + 2.5) = \\qty{154.85}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$，与表中值精确到", "最后一位相符。将 $p$ 除以 10 时，熵增加 $R\\ln10 = \\qty{19.14}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:9}", "$S^{\\mathrm R}_{\\mathrm m} = R[\\ln(298.15/15.02) + 1] = 8.3145 \\times (2.988 + 1) = \\qty{33.16}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:10}", "$\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd J}\\bigl[(2J+1)\\eu^{-\\theta J(J+1)/T}\\bigr] = \\bigl[2 - (2J+1)^2\\theta/T\\bigr]\\eu^{-\\theta J(J+1)/T} = 0$ 得", "$2J + 1 = \\sqrt{2T/\\theta}$，即 $J_{\\max} = \\sqrt{T/2\\theta} - \\frac12$。\\ce{HCl}：2.66，故 $J = 3$；\\ce{CO}：", "6.86，故 $J = 7$。P 支或 R 支谱线的强度跟随", "其下能级的布居数，在 $J_{\\max}$ 处达到峰值，", "该峰值位于距带中心间隙仅几条谱线之处。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:11}", "$\\int_0^\\infty f\\dd J = T/\\theta$，$f(0) = 1$，$f'(0) = 2 - \\theta/T$。由此可得 $q^{\\mathrm R} \\approx T/\\theta + \\frac12 -", "\\frac16 + \\frac{\\theta}{12T} \\approx T/\\theta + \\frac13$。以 $T/\\theta$ 近似时的相对误差约为 $\\theta/3T$：", "当 $T > 33\\,\\theta$ 时低于 1\\,\\%。对于 \\ce{H2}，$\\theta = 1.4388 \\times 59.32 = \\qty{85.3}{K}$：在", "\\qty{298.15}{K} 时误差为 10\\,\\%，不可接受（核自旋对 $J$ 的", "限制也须精确处理，见\\cref{ch:b3:statistical-thermo-applied}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:partition-functions:12}", "当 $x = \\theta_{\\mathrm V}/T \\to \\infty$ 时，$x/(\\eu^x - 1) \\to 0$，$\\ln(1 - \\eu^{-x}) \\to 0$，故 $S \\to 0$。当 $x \\to 0$ 时，", "$x/(\\eu^x - 1) \\approx 1 - x/2$，$-\\ln(1 - \\eu^{-x}) \\approx -\\ln x + x/2$，故 $S \\to R(1 - \\ln x) = R[1 + \\ln(T/\\theta_{\\mathrm V})]$。", "\\ce{I2}，$x = 1.029$：精确值 $R(0.5721 + 0.4420) = \\qty{8.43}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$；极限值 $R(1 - 0.0289) =", "\\qty{8.07}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$。即使在 $T \\approx \\theta_{\\mathrm V}$ 时，经典极限也只低 4\\,\\%。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b3:partition-functions:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $m = 28.014\\times10^{-3}/6.02214\\times10^{23} = \\qty{4.652e-26}{kg}$.", "\\textbf{2.} $\\Lambda = h/\\sqrt{2\\pi mkT} = \\qty{1.910e-11}{m}$ (\\qty{19.1}{pm}).", "\\textbf{3.} $kT/p^\\circ = 1.380649\\times10^{-23} \\times 298.15/10^5 = \\qty{4.116e-26}{m^3}$.", "\\textbf{4.} $q^{\\mathrm T}/N = 4.116\\times10^{-26}/(1.910\\times10^{-11})^3 = \\num{5.905e6}$：每个分子约有六百万个平动态，", "因此两个分子几乎不会共享同一状态，", "$Q = q^N/N!$ 成立。", "\\textbf{5.} $S^{\\mathrm T}_{\\mathrm m} = R(\\ln\\num{5.905e6} + \\frac52) = 8.3145 \\times 18.091 = \\qty{150.42}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$.", "\\textbf{6.} $+R\\ln2 = \\qty{5.76}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$，即 \\num{156.18}。", "\\textbf{7.} $B_0 = 1.998241 - 0.008659 = \\qty{1.989582}{cm^{-1}}$.", "\\textbf{8.} $\\theta_{\\mathrm R} = 1.438777 \\times 1.989582 = \\qty{2.8626}{K}$.", "\\textbf{9.} $\\sigma = 2$：两个原子核相同，将分子首尾翻转", "得到一个不可区分的取向，并且核的交换对称性", "对每种核自旋态只允许一半的转动能级。", "\\textbf{10.} $q^{\\mathrm R} = 298.15/(2 \\times 2.8626) = 52.08$.", "\\textbf{11.} 是：$T/\\theta_{\\mathrm R} = 104$，$q^{\\mathrm R}$ 的误差约为 0.3\\,\\%，", "而对熵的影响小得多。", "\\textbf{12.} $S^{\\mathrm R}_{\\mathrm m} = R(\\ln52.08 + 1) = 8.3145 \\times 4.9527 = \\qty{41.18}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$.", "\\textbf{13.} $J_{\\max} = \\sqrt{298.15/5.725} - 0.5 = 6.72$：$J = 7$（布居数 0.0839，刚好高于", "$J = 6$ 时的 0.0831）。", "\\textbf{14.} $2358.57 - 2 \\times 14.324 = \\qty{2329.92}{cm^{-1}}$.", "\\textbf{15.} $\\theta_{\\mathrm V} = 1.438777 \\times 2329.92 = \\qty{3352}{K}$.", "\\textbf{16.} $x = 3352.2/298.15 = 11.24$; $q^{\\mathrm V} = 1/(1 - \\eu^{-11.24}) = 1.000013$.", "\\textbf{17.} $\\eu^{-11.24}/q^{\\mathrm V} = \\num{1.3e-5}$.", "\\textbf{18.} $S^{\\mathrm V}_{\\mathrm m} = R[11.24\\eu^{-11.24} + \\eu^{-11.24}] = \\qty{0.0013}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$，可忽略不计。", "\\textbf{19.} $g_0 = 1$（${}^1\\Sigma$）：$R\\ln1 = 0$。激发电子态高出数个", "电子伏特，超过 $kT$ 一百多倍：其玻尔兹曼因子", "完全可以忽略。", "\\textbf{20.} $150.42 + 41.18 + 0.00 + 0 = \\qty{191.60}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$.", "\\textbf{21.} 两者之差为 \\qty{0.01}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}，与所作", "近似（刚性转子、运动分离）的水平相当。", "\\textbf{22.} 从几开尔文起测得的固体热容（以下按 $T^3$ 外推），", "固–固转变、熔化和汽化的焓各除以相应温度，", "气体的热容，", "以及非理想性的修正。", "\\textbf{23.} 核在每个反应中都守恒，因此其自旋熵在反应两侧相同，", "并相互抵消；量热法同样探测不到其影响，因为", "核自旋在晶体中直到", "可测的最低温度都保持无序。", "\\textbf{24.} \\textbf{$S^\\circ(\\ce{N2}, \\qty{298.15}{K}) = \\qty{191.6}{J.K^{-1}.mol^{-1}}$ 由光谱常数求得}，", "其中 150.4 来自平动，41.2 来自转动。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}